  "interpretation": "For a genuinely isolated single component the sum of its endpoint-star energies is its independent stored energy. Before separation or after splitting this is only the energy of the chosen identity set. K_internal is kinetic energy relative to this set COM. Power is instantaneous using the archived force-evaluation half velocity; these samples are not a reconstructed work integral. Uniform component-COM drag does not directly damp internal relative motion of an intact free component. This is a testable secondary-breakup mechanism, not a demonstrated causal replacement for the initial failure mechanism."
